unding to the nearest percent gives approximately $77\\%$ per minute." 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718602 1080 "$67\\%$ per minute" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718602 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718602 1083 #uuid "70786690-4a26-54db-9ea8-72c5999e4729" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718603 1080 "$120$ years" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718603 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718603 1083 #uuid "71424a84-6149-5baa-b6ce-545fbc2c40e4" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718604 1080 "$116$ years" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718604 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718604 1083 #uuid "752c4308-5934-5c79-a462-64f87f1e0ef9" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718605 1068 #edb/ref 17592186718614 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718605 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718605 1071 "In a biology class, the teacher began the experiment with $25$ bacteria in a petri dish. After $14$ minutes, the number of bacteria increased to $184$. What was the continuously compounded growth rate of the bacteria? Round your answer to the nearest percent.\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question." 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718605 1072 #uuid "7ad32226-32ee-52d3-ad07-c7cf248ffbb3" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718605 1073 true 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718605 1074 "The initial population is $P_0=25$, the final population is $P=184$, and the elapsed time is $t=14$ minutes. The decimal rate $r$ is per minute.\n\nUse the continuously compounded growth equation, isolate the exponential, take natural logarithms, and solve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nP &= P_0e^{rt} \\\\\n184 &= 25e^{14r} \\\\\ne^{14r} &= \\frac{184}{25} \\\\\n\\ln\\left(e^{14r}\\right) &= \\ln\\left(\\frac{184}{25}\\right) \\\\\n14r &= \\ln\\left(\\frac{184}{25}\\right) \\\\\nr &= \\frac{\\ln\\left(\\frac{184}{25}\\right)}{14} \\\\\nr &\\approx 0.1425757 \\\\\n100r &\\approx 14.25757\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConverting the decimal rate to a percentage and rounding to the nearest percent gives approximately $14\\%$ per minute." 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718606 1080 "$83\\%$ per minute" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718606 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718606 1083 #uuid "7b4017a4-42e9-5326-a589-4eec872a59aa" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718607 1080 "$61\\%$ per minute" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718607 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718607 1083 #uuid "7d3a3d21-e3e1-5503-8ce4-d06000037f07" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718608 1068 #edb/ref 17592186718622 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718608 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718608 1071 "There are currently $498$ koalas living in a secluded forest, but their population is decreasing at a continuously compounded rate of $3.4\\%$ per year. How many years must pass for there to be only $12$ koalas left in that forest? Round your answer to the nearest integer.\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question." 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718608 1072 #uuid "88863802-911c-559b-a7a4-c6fd80ee55d9" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718608 1073 true 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718608 1074 "The initial population is $P_0=498$ and the final population is $P=12$. A decrease of $3.4\\%$ per year means $r=-0.034$, with $t$ in years.\n\nUse the continuously compounded growth equation, isolate the exponential, take natural logarithms, and solve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nP &= P_0e^{rt} \\\\\n12 &= 498e^{-0.034t} \\\\\ne^{-0.034t} &= \\frac{12}{498} \\\\\n\\ln\\left(e^{-0.034t}\\right) &= \\ln\\left(\\frac{12}{498}\\right) \\\\\n-0.034t &= \\ln\\left(\\frac{12}{498}\\right) \\\\\nt &= \\frac{\\ln\\left(\\frac{12}{498}\\right)}{-0.034} \\\\\nt &\\approx 109.57922 \\\\\nt &\\approx 110\\text{ years}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the time is approximately $110$ years." 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718609 1075 #edb/ref 17592186718595 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718609 1075 #edb/ref 17592186718596 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718609 1075 #edb/ref 17592186718602 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718609 1075 #edb/ref 17592186718607 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718609 1075 #edb/ref 17592186718615 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718609 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718609 1077 "selection" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718609 1078 #edb/ref 17592186718607 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718609 1079 #uuid "890957f7-308f-5ec1-b8ff-30e14a3050ba" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718610 1080 "$19\\%$ per minute" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718610 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718610 1083 #uuid "9718cd12-6a3a-59f8-9358-ca178c4f0045" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718611 1080 "$14\\%$ per minute" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718611 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718611 1083 #uuid "99891059-8278-5f3d-bad3-bf3531b618f2" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718612 1080 "$108$ years" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718612 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718612 1083 #uuid "a666c559-f529-56ad-9486-a2b1e8b2db68" 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718613 1075 #edb/ref 17592186718591 13194139541591 17592186576411 true] [17592186718613 1075 #edb/ref 1759218